        {
          "exampleId": "w:test#e-11bcecb9b0fae93b",
          "text": "Class activities will vary from day to day, but students must be ready to complete short in-class writings or tests drawn directly from assigned readings or notes from the previous class' lecture/discussion, so it is important to take careful notes during class.",
